  "entries": [
    {
      "name": "Shadow's Displeasure",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "When Mariama has fewer than 150 Hit Points, his shadow pulls at his essence to show the Vesicant Egg's displeasure. She looks pained and confused, and she becomes clumsy 1 and stupefied 1 until healed to 150 Hit Points or more. These conditions increase to 2 when below 100 Hit Points. When below 50 Hit Points, she falls unconscious."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Vesicated Shadow",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Mariama's shadow has become corrupted via the power of the Vesicant Egg. Her shredded shadow grants him some control over acid and shadows. She gains a +4 status bonus to resist acid and shadow effects."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Weird Astrology",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Perhaps because of Mariama's quirky nature, she has received all the effects of the astrological evaluator. When she gains any of the clumsy 1, drained, enfeebled, or stupefied conditions, she reduces the value by 1. This means her Shadow's Displeasure doesn't affect her until she has fewer than 50 Hit Points, when she falls unconscious."
      ]
    },
